OL,3,GNEWSABrewery looks to expand to produce
OL,4,Acider and honey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Shropshire-based brewery is hoping to
OL,7,Fmove into producing cider and honey
OL,8,Funder plans for an expansion.
OL,10,FMad Badger Brewery, near Criftins,
OL,11,FEllesmere, produces craft beverages.
OL,13,FOwner Simon Smith has submitted plans
OL,14,Fto add three polytunnels and a barn,
OL,15,Fwhich he said would "enable productive,
OL,16,Fsustainable use of the land".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
