OL,3,GNEWSABrewery looks to expand to produce
OL,4,Acider and honey
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This project represents both a
OL,7,Fpractical agricultural venture and a
OL,8,Fmeaningful return to the county where I
OL,9,Fgrew up and intend to build my
OL,10,Flong-term future," he said in a
OL,11,Fstatement to Shropshire Council.
